// The outdoor logger runs only once in a new game; memory logger once on
// the first visit to any supported memory area.

// Slot-based fallback exclusively for three original Candlekeep Imoen
// callbacks that previously relied on IsValidForPartyDialog("Imoen2").
EXTEND_TOP ~QCHLAR.BCS~ ~CotSC/qc_unicorn_grove/scripts/QC30HLAR.baf~
EXTEND_TOP ~QCHINAR.BCS~ ~CotSC/qc_unicorn_grove/scripts/QC30INAR.baf~
EXTEND_TOP ~QCHSTAR.BCS~ ~CotSC/qc_unicorn_grove/scripts/QC30STAR.baf~

// Public installer: development progress message omitted.

// v31: The original Candlekeep script calls used StartDialog(), which changes
// the actual party NPC's assigned dialogue file permanently. This can leave
// Imoen pointing at QCHIMTR / QCHSTIM rather than IMOEN2J until party restore.
// Use the non-destructive StartDialogOverride and give failed early attempts
// a retry, without changing her actual creature, dialogue strings or identity.

// ---------- Integrated milestone: QC: v31 - Imoen Fresh-Game Dialogue Repair (no save/reload required)~ ----------
ACTION_IF NOT FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~QCI29INI.BCS~ BEGIN FAIL ~Install v29 and v30 components first.~ END
ACTION_IF NOT FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~QCHLAR.BCS~ BEGIN FAIL ~Nightmare Candlekeep must be installed first.~ END
ACTION_IF NOT FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~QCHINAR.BCS~ BEGIN FAIL ~Nightmare Candlekeep interior must be installed first.~ END
ACTION_IF NOT FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~QCHSTAR.BCS~ BEGIN FAIL ~Nightmare Candlekeep storage must be installed first.~ END

// Correct existing compiled v30 actions as well, so none of them can replace
// the joined dialogue with an unrelated scripted conversation.
COPY_EXISTING ~QCHLAR.BCS~ ~override/QCHLAR.BCS~
  DECOMPILE_AND_PATCH BEGIN
    REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~StartDialog(~ ~StartDialogOverride(~
  END
BUT_ONLY_IF_IT_CHANGES
COPY_EXISTING ~QCHINAR.BCS~ ~override/QCHINAR.BCS~
  DECOMPILE_AND_PATCH BEGIN
    REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~StartDialog(~ ~StartDialogOverride(~
  END
BUT_ONLY_IF_IT_CHANGES
COPY_EXISTING ~QCHSTAR.BCS~ ~override/QCHSTAR.BCS~
  DECOMPILE_AND_PATCH BEGIN
    REPLACE_TEXTUALLY ~StartDialog(~ ~StartDialogOverride(~
  END
BUT_ONLY_IF_IT_CHANGES

